'''Hoppity''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Village}} that appears during [[Hoppity's Hunt]] event that sells [[Chocolate Rabbits]].

== Shop ==
'''Hoppity''' sells 7 random [[Chocolate Rabbits]] between {{Common}}-{{Legendary}} rarity during [[Hoppity's Hunt]]. Their selection differs between players and is based on the [[Chocolate Factory]]'s prestige:

