Each rabbit can only be purchased once per season. {{Common}} rabbits cost {{c|200k}}, {{Uncommon}} rabbits cost {{c|500k}}, {{Rare}} rabbits cost {{c|1m}}, {{Epic}} rabbits cost {{c|2.5m}}, {{Legendary}} rabbits cost {{c|5m}}. If said rabbit has already been found before, purchasing the rabbit will grant {{Chocolate}} instead, with the amount depending on the rarity of the rabbit.

=== Abiphone Contact ===
Once Hoppity's [[Abiphones#Contacts|{{Aqua|Abiphone Contact}}]] has been acquired, Hoppity will randomly call the player ({{Green|2%}} chance, rolled per [[SkyBlock Day]]), independent of whether [[Hoppity's Hunt]] is active. During this call Hoppity will offer to sell the player a [[Chocolate Rabbit]] between {{Common}}-{{Epic}} rarity:
